{"id":"8727007e6f227c84","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-regular-category.md","title":"有明确核偶的正则范畴","display":"df-regular-category — 有明确核偶的正则范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-regular-category","aliases":["16-df-regular-category","Regular category"],"display":"df-regular-category — 有明确核偶的正则范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"§4.4 pp. 256–265 (PDF 276–285)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-regular-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-regular-category</span><span>Regular category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-category — 有明确核偶的正则范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§4.4 pp. 256–265 (PDF 276–285)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是小范畴；有限极限与拉回泛性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 时定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:A\\to B\">\\(e:A\\to B\\)</span>，选定核偶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_e\">\\(K_e\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_1^e,r_2^e:K_e\\to A\">\\(r_1^e,r_2^e:K_e\\to A\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1^e,r_2^e;e,e)\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1^e,r_2^e;e,e)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^*e\">\\(g^*e\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:C\\to B\">\\(g:C\\to B\\)</span> 的选定拉回投影；不同选择只差唯一同构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCat},\\mathrm{RegEpi}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCat},\\mathrm{RegEpi}\\)</span> 在本页定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e:A\\to B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal C(A,Z))\\\n\\left(hr_1^e=hr_2^e\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal C(B,Z))\\ ke=h\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}(e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C(A,B))\n(\\exists I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists e\\in\\mathcal C(A,I),m\\in\\mathcal C(I,B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}(f=me\\land\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\forall e\\in\\mathcal C(A,B),g\\in\\mathcal C(C,B))\\\n(\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(g^*e)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e:A\\to B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal C(A,Z))\\\n\\left(hr_1^e=hr_2^e\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal C(B,Z))\\ ke=h\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}(e)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal C)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C(A,B))\n(\\exists I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists e\\in\\mathcal C(A,I),m\\in\\mathcal C(I,B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}(f=me\\land\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\forall e\\in\\mathcal C(A,B),g\\in\\mathcal C(C,B))\\\n(\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(g^*e)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§4.4, pp. 256–265 (PDF 276–285)。有限极限下，“某对箭头的余等化子”与“自身核偶的余等化子”给出相同的正则 epi 概念。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 的余等化子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 经核偶因子化，任何等化核偶的箭头也等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>；反向由核偶本身立即成立。因此该表述没有偷偷加强原书概念。所有 Mono 明确在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 中判断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是小范畴；有限极限与拉回泛性质见 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]。以下 $\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}$ 在 $\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)$ 时定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是小范畴；有限极限与拉回泛性质见 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]。以下 $\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}$ 在 $\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)$ 时定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat},\\mathrm{RegEpi}$ 在本页定义；$\\mathrm{Mono}$ 见 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"e:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"K_e","display":false},{"tex":"r_1^e,r_2^e:K_e\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal C}(r_1^e,r_2^e;e,e)","display":false},{"tex":"g^*e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"g:C\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegCat},\\mathrm{RegEpi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e:A\\to B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal C(A,Z))\\\n\\left(hr_1^e=hr_2^e\\Longrightarrow\n(\\exists!k\\in\\mathcal C(B,Z))\\ ke=h\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegEpi}(e)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal C)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal C(A,B))\n(\\exists I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists e\\in\\mathcal C(A,I),m\\in\\mathcal C(I,B))\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}(f=me\\land\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal C}(m))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\forall e\\in\\mathcal C(A,B),g\\in\\mathcal C(C,B))\\\n(\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(e)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RegEpi}_{\\mathcal C}(g^*e)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":2293,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a42bbee3cfe3d34","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为小范畴，正则性见 [[16-df-regular-category]]。$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)$ 及其偏序 $\\leq_I$、拉回 $u^*$ 见 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。"},{"id":"aec0a4cad490cf4e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$ 采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]；$\\mathrm{RegCat}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"},{"id":"a79a60a788ea47ca","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$ 采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]。$\\mathrm{Coeq}_{\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathrm{FinColim}$、$\\mathrm{Exact}$ 在下文定义；Exact 沿用原书 p. 297 的“正则且有余等化子”用法。"},{"id":"5a9f42708ce20d55","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$、$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-regular-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75e7c168ac56b22","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}